                "Path frame_id is '%s' but positions are applied on the map frame "
                "(odom_origin_x=%.3f y=%.3f yaw=%.3f). Check odom_origin_* parameters.",
                msg->header.frame_id.c_str(), odom_origin_x_, odom_origin_y_,
